      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Caverna. Druddigon vive em cavernas, mas nunca deixa de tomar sol, pois não consegue se mover se o corpo esfriar demais. Cruel e astuto, ele ocupa ninhos escavados por outros Pokémon e os transforma em seu próprio covil.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 10 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Druddigon não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Hone Claws</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Metal Claw, Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Dragon Rage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Crunch, Dragon Claw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Chip Away</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Revenge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Night Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Dragon Tail, Iron Head, Rock Climb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Superpower</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Outrage</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Aqua Tail, Attract, Bulldoze, Charge Beam, Confide, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Draco Meteor, Dragon Claw, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Tail, Dual Wingbeat, Earthquake, Facade, Fire Fang, Fire Punch, Flamethrower, Flash Cannon, Fling, Focus Blast, Frustration, Giga Impact, Gunk Shot, Heat Wave, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Lash Out, Mega Punch, Outrage, Payback, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Revenge, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Scale Shot, Scary Face, Shadow Claw, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Smack Down, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Surf, Swagger, Taunt, Thunder Fang, Thunder Punch, Torment, Toxic</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Crush Claw, Feint Attack, Fire Fang, Glare, Iron Tail, Metal Claw, Night Slash, Poison Tail, Pursuit, Snatch, Sucker Punch, Thunder Fang</p>",
